  entryLines:
  - text: "Bude\u0161 se n\xE1m je\u0161t\u011B sm\xE1t co?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Neeeee u\u017E neee."
    speakerName: Fitak
  - text: "Kdo ti v\u016Fbec nalil takovou b\u0159e\u010Dku?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "N\u011Bkdo vevnit\u0159, j\xE1 u\u017E nev\xEDm, nech m\u011B b\xFDt."
    speakerName: Fitak
  - text: "Hmmm, na to bych se m\u011Bla pod\xEDvat."
    speakerName: Branice
